---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { business, mailto, sms } from '../data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How SELI Wash Co. handles information used to request a concrete cleaning estimate."
>
  <section class="band band-ink page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="display">Privacy notice.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This page explains what information is requested and how the website's
        text-message estimate workflow handles it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-paper">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2 class="sec-h">Information you choose to provide</h2>
      <p>
        The estimate form asks for your name, contact details, property address,
        requested services, timing, water and power access, notes, and optional
        photo selections.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">How the estimate form works</h2>
      <p>
        Your answers stay in your own browser. The form checks them there and
        writes them into a text message addressed to {business.phone.display}.
        Nothing is transmitted to this website, and nothing is stored on it —
        there is no account, no database, and no submission step.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your details leave your device only when you open your messaging app and
        press send. If you close the page or navigate away before then, the
        answers go with it and we never see them.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website does not upload photos. Choosing photos on the form only
        lists their filenames in the message so you know which ones to add;
        attach the images themselves in your messaging app.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">When you send a message</h2>
      <p>
        {business.name} receives your information only once you have sent the
        text. Messages, calls, and emails are carried by your own phone or email
        provider and arrive directly with us. We use what you send to review and
        answer your estimate request. We do not add you to a marketing list and
        do not send promotional messages.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not currently use analytics, advertising trackers, or
        marketing cookies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="sec-h">Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Text {business.phone.display} or email{' '}
        <a class="inline-link" href={mailto}>{business.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="actions legal-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href={sms}>Text {business.phone.display}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head .eyebrow { color: var(--amber); }
  .page-head h1 {
    margin-block: 0.7rem 1rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, var(--s8));
  }
  .page-head .lede { color: var(--slate-ltr); }
  .sec-h {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--s5);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sec-h:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
  .inline-link { color: var(--amber-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .legal-actions { margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
